          "Our informational website and legal pages do not include advertising or analytics trackers. The mobile app's advertising processing and privacy choices are described in sections 6 and 19. Browser Do-Not-Track settings do not change an app's advertising permission or consent setting. Where an applicable law requires us to honor an opt-out preference signal, we will do so; this notice does not waive that requirement."
